1
00:00:39,600 --> 00:00:40,830
Please descend,

2
00:00:41,200 --> 00:00:42,430
Great Demon God Xu!

3
00:00:50,430 --> 00:00:51,430
This aura...

4
00:00:52,160 --> 00:00:53,220
It's actually him.

5
00:00:53,460 --> 00:00:55,660
The one who descended from the heavens.

6
00:00:57,230 --> 00:00:58,360
Did it work?

7
00:00:58,430 --> 00:00:59,860
Is that... Demon God Xu?

8
00:01:01,460 --> 00:01:03,060
The Demon God has descended!

9
00:01:03,700 --> 00:01:05,230
His power shakes the world!

10
00:01:05,700 --> 00:01:07,230
His power shakes the world!

11
00:01:08,030 --> 00:01:09,400
Enough, stop shouting.

12
00:01:09,660 --> 00:01:11,060
This guy is just a mortal.

13
00:01:11,060 --> 00:01:12,390
He is no Demon God at all.

14
00:01:18,700 --> 00:01:19,760
Who are you?

15
00:01:20,160 --> 00:01:21,260
What Demon God Xu?

16
00:01:21,630 --> 00:01:23,830
I don't understand what you're saying.

17
00:01:24,900 --> 00:01:26,130
It seems you don't know

18
00:01:26,130 --> 00:01:28,730
the consequences of trespassing
on the altar.

19
00:01:34,259 --> 00:01:35,860
Why is he suddenly chanting?

20
00:01:38,259 --> 00:01:39,229
Look!

21
00:01:39,229 --> 00:01:42,090
The High Priest has opened
the Eye of the True Demon.

22
00:01:48,229 --> 00:01:50,490
Offer him as a sacrifice to the Demon God!

23
00:01:50,530 --> 00:01:53,460
This is the consequence of trespassing
on the altar.

24
00:01:56,100 --> 00:01:56,960
My head hurts.

25
00:01:57,160 --> 00:01:57,530
No!

26
00:01:57,530 --> 00:01:58,800
I can't be sucked in!

27
00:01:59,000 --> 00:01:59,600
No!

28
00:02:00,800 --> 00:02:01,600
No!

29
00:02:05,060 --> 00:02:05,520
Where is

30
00:02:05,900 --> 00:02:06,700
this?

31
00:02:09,800 --> 00:02:11,300
Was that just a dream?

32
00:02:11,600 --> 00:02:13,230
Or did someone save me?

33
00:02:18,430 --> 00:02:19,430
Women's clothes?

34
00:02:19,860 --> 00:02:21,720
My identity has been discovered.

35
00:02:23,400 --> 00:02:24,700
I should go out and ask.

36
00:02:37,630 --> 00:02:39,230
My Lady, you're awake.

37
00:02:39,430 --> 00:02:40,200
Sir,

38
00:02:40,660 --> 00:02:41,900
where am I?

39
00:02:42,200 --> 00:02:43,829
This is the Qi Residence in Qiong City.

40
00:02:43,829 --> 00:02:45,060
I am Steward Lin.

41
00:02:45,100 --> 00:02:48,160
Our master saved you
and brought you back a few days ago.

42
00:02:50,030 --> 00:02:51,260
Who is your master?

43
00:02:51,260 --> 00:02:52,400
He saved my life.

44
00:02:52,430 --> 00:02:55,200
Wearing this bead will make one
immune to all poisons.

45
00:02:55,200 --> 00:02:56,900
Consider it my token of gratitude.

46
00:02:56,900 --> 00:02:58,000
As for thanking him,

47
00:02:58,000 --> 00:02:59,660
please wait until the master returns

48
00:02:59,660 --> 00:03:00,920
and tell him in person.

49
00:03:08,030 --> 00:03:08,700
I heard

50
00:03:09,200 --> 00:03:11,630
that Yinyue Pavilion's business
used to be very poor,

51
00:03:11,630 --> 00:03:13,560
until a young man named

52
00:03:13,560 --> 00:03:15,160
Qi Yan took over 10 years ago.

53
00:03:15,330 --> 00:03:17,160
It expanded rapidly

54
00:03:17,160 --> 00:03:18,260
in just three months.

55
00:03:18,260 --> 00:03:19,500
Exactly.

56
00:03:19,730 --> 00:03:21,460
Now it's not just a restaurant.

57
00:03:21,530 --> 00:03:24,730
The Qi Residence's business covers banks,
fabric shops,

58
00:03:24,860 --> 00:03:25,860
and even theaters.

59
00:03:25,860 --> 00:03:26,860
But no one knows

60
00:03:27,329 --> 00:03:28,790
Qi Yan's true background.

61
00:03:28,829 --> 00:03:29,560
Sect Leader,

62
00:03:29,700 --> 00:03:31,430
why are you suddenly stepping out
from behind the scenes?

63
00:03:31,430 --> 00:03:33,090
You should call me Master now.

64
00:03:33,730 --> 00:03:35,030
Probably because I haven't felt

65
00:03:35,030 --> 00:03:36,630
what it's like to be human
for a long time.

66
00:03:36,630 --> 00:03:38,090
Besides, no one knows that

67
00:03:38,130 --> 00:03:39,730
Qi Yan, the master of the Qi family,

68
00:03:39,730 --> 00:03:41,790
is Yan Mo, the Sect Leader of Yan Sect.

69
00:03:42,900 --> 00:03:44,530
Alright, you go back first.

70
00:03:44,530 --> 00:03:46,390
I need to visit Yungong Pavilion.

71
00:03:48,760 --> 00:03:50,360
It is said that Yungong Pavilion

72
00:03:50,360 --> 00:03:51,420
knows everything.

73
00:03:51,530 --> 00:03:53,100
What is the Sect Leader going to do there?

74
00:03:53,100 --> 00:03:54,500
To gather intelligence.

75
00:03:56,360 --> 00:03:58,820
He must want to know things
related to Madam.

76
00:04:05,760 --> 00:04:09,290
A few days ago, Chi Lian suddenly appeared
and asked us for help.

77
00:04:09,360 --> 00:04:11,660
The Sect Leader went to save her
without hesitation.

78
00:04:11,660 --> 00:04:13,860
He is indeed still worried about Madam.

79
00:04:13,930 --> 00:04:14,600
Guard Ye,

80
00:04:14,760 --> 00:04:15,960
you're finally back.

81
00:04:16,300 --> 00:04:18,560
The lady the Master brought back ran away,

82
00:04:18,560 --> 00:04:20,459
leaving only a note and a bead.

83
00:04:21,500 --> 00:04:21,959
What?

84
00:04:22,230 --> 00:04:22,930
Let me see.

85
00:04:25,230 --> 00:04:26,660
I'll go find the Master right away.

86
00:04:26,660 --> 00:04:28,430
Get everyone to look for this lady.

87
00:04:28,430 --> 00:04:29,230
Yes.

88
00:04:30,930 --> 00:04:32,130
Young Master Yan,

89
00:04:32,360 --> 00:04:34,890
it's an honor to have you
at Yungong Pavilion.

90
00:04:38,730 --> 00:04:40,230
Skip the pleasantries.

91
00:04:41,230 --> 00:04:43,630
Any results

92
00:04:44,060 --> 00:04:46,860
on the person I asked you
to look into a few days ago?

93
00:04:46,960 --> 00:04:47,760
Uh,

94
00:04:49,760 --> 00:04:50,530
well...

95
00:04:50,530 --> 00:04:51,560
Master, bad news!

96
00:04:51,659 --> 00:04:53,030
Lord Envoy, bad news!

97
00:04:58,060 --> 00:04:58,900
What is it?

98
00:05:00,100 --> 00:05:02,260
Master, Madam is...

99
00:05:02,260 --> 00:05:03,360
missing.

100
00:05:03,960 --> 00:05:04,830
Lord Envoy,

101
00:05:04,930 --> 00:05:07,130
someone broke into the forbidden area.

102
00:05:08,260 --> 00:05:10,500
They say Yungong Pavilion
knows everything.

103
00:05:10,500 --> 00:05:13,900
I can definitely find out
about Chilian's whereabouts here.

104
00:05:16,630 --> 00:05:17,960
High walls everywhere.

105
00:05:18,130 --> 00:05:19,230
I'm lost again.

106
00:05:21,530 --> 00:05:23,390
This brick looks a bit different.

107
00:05:34,130 --> 00:05:36,159
This is...
